<title>SPAIN: Madrid stock exchange evacuated after bomb threat.</title>
<headline>Madrid stock exchange evacuated after bomb threat.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid stock exchange was evacuated on Tuesday morning after a bomb threat was phoned in, witnesses and police said.</p>
<p>Trading in small, marginal stocks was interrupted but the major part of market activity via screen-based trading was unaffected.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
